      "label": "Stereotype: Black people are hypersensitive to odors",
      "description": "This stereotype is used in the meme to imply that Black people are overly sensitive to smells, particularly the racial slur 'nigger'. This is a false and demeaning generalization that reduces Black people to their supposed sensory reactions, which is a form of racial stereotyping and discrimination.",
