      "description": "The meme uses a racial slur and a false stereotype to demean and dehumanize Black individuals by associating them with a repulsive odor and suggesting they are hypersensitive to it, which is both offensive and harmful. The visual of the man with a stern expression reinforces the tone of accusation and hostility, amplifying the toxic message.",
